    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">For interstate movements involving goods above the specified value, a valid e-Way Bill is mandatory under GST regulations. This digital document facilitates smooth passage through check stations and verifies the legality of the goods being transported. Reputable companies handle this filing electronically, ensuring zero delays at state borders.</p>
