    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The Lorry Receipt acts as the primary contract between the shipper and the carrier. An IBA (Indian Business Association) approved LR confirms that the logistics provider is registered and compliant with industry standards. This document details the shipment contents, weight, and route, serving as proof of delivery and a crucial legal instrument in case of disputes.</p>
